const pricingMain=`<section class="membership-hero container"><p class="eyebrow">CrakkerXworld.AI MEMBERSHIP</p><h1>Simple plans, <span>more power.</span></h1><p>All eight tools stay free. Upgrade for larger batches and higher usage allowances. Pay once for 30 days—no automatic renewal.</p><p class="pricing-note">Prices in INR · Inclusive of applicable taxes where chargeable · No surprise renewal</p></section><section class="container" id="pricing-grid" aria-label="Membership plans"><div id="plan-cards" class="plan-grid"><p>Loading plans…</p></div><p class="fine-print">* Ultra: unlimited monthly conversions subject to reasonable fair use, 1 GB maximum input per task, server resource limits and service availability. Prices and limits are proposals until checkout is enabled. No guaranteed conversion speed. Conversion files are processed locally in the visitor’s browser; no Python conversion service is required.</p><div class="faq-list price-faq"><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><details><summary>Will free tools keep working without signup?</summary><p>Yes. The original free conversion tools remain available. Premium access is optional.</p></details><details><summary>Is payment recurring?</summary><p>No. Each payment purchases a 30-day pass. You need to manually buy another pass to renew.</p></details><details><summary>How do I ask about a payment or refund?</summary><p>For a payment that appears incorrect or is not reflected in your account, use the <a href="../contact/">Contact Us</a> form and include the order or payment reference. Any refund entitlement is governed by the terms shown at checkout and applicable law. This website does not publish a separate refund policy or promise that every payment is refundable.</p></details></div></section>`;
write('pricing/index.html',layout({title:'Pricing & Membership',description:'Compare CrakkerXworld.AI free, Normal, Plus, Pro and Ultra plans.',main:pricingMain,depth:1,slug:'pricing',contentClass:'membership-page'}));
